	(text "Per return (ARCHITECTURE.md 5.2-5.3): series diode from the connector, 1 k pull-up to +4.5 V, 220 R + 100 nF, LM339 against\nVREF (2.25 V). Output 1 = open, 0 = closed, as the ROM expects. Connector pin to return order follows the original drawing:\nverify with a meter before relying on it."
